# Hand-assigned combat ratings. This file is the `rated` layer and nothing else.
# Quality, pools, type and stat deltas are NOT here on purpose — those are the
# `scraped` layer and come from items.xml / itempools.xml via tools/scrape.mjs.
#
# Format: id|name|offense|aoe|tracking|defense|evasion|tags|note
# Ranges: offense 0.5-3.0 | aoe 0.5-3.0 | tracking 0-1 | defense 0.8-2.5 | evasion 0-1
# Neutral item is 1.0|1.0|0.0|1.0|0.0. Sad Onion (1.22 offense) is the anchor.

# --- Tear replacements and the top of the damage ladder -----------------------
COLLECTIBLE_BRIMSTONE|Brimstone|2.40|1.60|0.30|1.00|0.00|laser,piercing,charged,replaces_tears|Charged laser. Enormous single-target, wasted shots on blink.
COLLECTIBLE_MOMS_KNIFE|Mom's Knife|2.30|0.75|0.55|1.00|0.00|knife,piercing,charged,replaces_tears|Devastating single-target, poor against swarms. Beast-unfriendly.
