COLLECTIBLE_TECHNOLOGY|Technology|1.55|1.15|0.30|1.00|0.00|laser,piercing|Continuous piercing laser. Reliable, unspectacular, always fine.
COLLECTIBLE_TECHNOLOGY_2|Technology 2|1.45|1.10|0.30|1.00|0.00|laser|Permanent thin laser alongside weakened tears. Great with multipliers.
COLLECTIBLE_TECH_5|Tech.5|1.60|1.20|0.30|1.00|0.00|laser|Free laser on top of an unchanged tear build. Pure addition.
COLLECTIBLE_SPIRIT_SWORD|Spirit Sword|1.85|1.30|0.00|1.15|0.00|melee,reflect,replaces_tears|Melee swing that reflects projectiles. Strong but demands close range.
COLLECTIBLE_C_SECTION|C Section|1.80|1.25|0.20|1.00|0.00|replaces_tears|Fetus wave with no travel time. Very high uptime damage.
COLLECTIBLE_MONSTROS_LUNG|Monstro's Lung|1.60|1.75|0.00|1.00|0.00|multishot,charged|Charged shotgun blast. Huge burst, awkward against movers.
COLLECTIBLE_MAW_OF_THE_VOID|Maw of the Void|1.65|1.70|0.20|1.05|0.00|aura,charged|Charged black ring plus a damage-up. Clears rooms and heals off kills.

